agent: **Here is a proposed starting point for your request:**
  # Weekly Reorder Point Alert
  ## Problem
  Popular items sell out before anyone notices. Orders then wait for stock, which breaks one-day shipping.
  ## Actors
  The warehouse lead, who checks stock. Customers, whose orders wait for stock.
  ## Current Process
  The warehouse lead checks stock against reorder points by hand every Monday in a spreadsheet.
  ## Desired Change
  Items at or below their reorder point are found automatically each week, with one alert sent to the warehouse lead. The solution is scheduled automation, preferably on GitHub Actions, with no new paid vendors.
  ## Success Measure
  No order waits on an item that was below its reorder point at the previous alert.
  ## Business Constraints
  No business constraints.
  ## Solution Constraints
  - **Allowed Solution Classes:** Scheduled automation
  - **Existing Platforms Required:** None
  - **Existing Platforms Preferred:** GitHub Actions
  - **Known Systems:** The weekly stock-check spreadsheet kept by the warehouse lead
